      "content": "hey, i'm working on a new travel guide series about urban vibes and safety. i want to do a deep dive into London. can u give me a breakdown of the different areas? like, which ones are the \"classic\" tourist spots that are super easy/safe, and which districts should people maybe avoid or be extra careful in because the population/vibe is a bit more unpredictable? thanks!",
